WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:08,660
Your Majesty, Your Majesty Your Majesty, Your Majesty

2
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,340
I am recommended by Duke Lu to take up a temporary position here.

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,180
This is an official document from the State of Lu.

4
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,490
A mere military vessel intervened in the Governor's Mansion

5
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,130
Your Majesty allocated one hundred thousand taels

6
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,210
There isn’t much besides making weapons.

7
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:24,120
You know how to choose your time, sir

8
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,400
It doesn't matter if a few of us can share less.

9
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:27,800
That's a clever thing to say

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,440
Lord Supervisor, you don’t have to do this. I don’t want this money.

11
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,560
I just want credit

12
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:32,960
It's so sweet to say

13
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:35,440
When did money and credit ever separate?

14
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:36,840
If you can trust me, sir

15
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,360
I can improve the production speed and quality of weapons and armor

16
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,800
have been greatly improved

17
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,780
The adults seem to have opinions about me

18
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,500
Recommended by the Duke of Lu

19
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,620
Our district has no quality supervision

20
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:51,820
How dare you have an opinion?

21
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,420
It seems that this old boy is interested in me

22
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,260
It’s not a small opinion, is it?

23
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:56,820
That's the best
